## Attention Co-processing (xPU + Logic-PIM Request-Level Attention Scheduling)

术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
Attention Co-processing是Duplex提出的attention层runtime kernel调度技术，在continuous batching的mixed stage中利用attention operation per-request独立的特性，将prefilling sequence（新到达request的长input sequence）的attention kernel调度到xPU执行（高Op/B GEMM：Lin个Q slices共享同一K/V矩阵），将decoding sequences（ongoing requests的单token generation）的attention kernel调度到Logic-PIM执行（低Op/B：per-request Q vector × unique KV cache）。两组kernel在不同处理单元上并行执行，bank bundle-aware memory allocation确保无memory access冲突。

从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kernel调度的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
Attention Co-processing的调度伪代码（以Mixtral 47B, GQA deggrp=4, mixed stage: 1 prefill request Lin=2048 + 64 decoding requests为例）：

```
// Mixed stage: 1 prefill request (Lin=2048) + 64 decoding requests
// GQA: 32 heads, deggrp=4 => 8 groups, each group shares K/V
// D_head = 128, D = 4096

// === xPU: Prefill attention ===
for g in range(8):  // each head group
    Q_prefill = Q[prefill_req, g*4:(g+1)*4]  // [2048, 4, 128] -> [2048, 512]
    K_prefill = K_cache[prefill_req, g]      // [2048, 128]
    V_prefill = V_cache[prefill_req, g]      // [2048, 128]

    // GEMM: Q_prefill × K_prefill^T  [2048, 512] × [128, 2048] = [2048, 2048]
    // High Op/B: 2048 Q rows share same K → 2*2048*512*2048/128 FLOPs
    //                                  ÷ (2048*512 + 2048*128 + 2048*2048) bytes
    // xPU H100 SMs execute this efficiently

    attn_scores = softmax(QK_out / sqrt(128))  // [2048, 2048]
    attn_out = attn_scores × V_prefill          // [2048, 2048] × [2048, 128]
    // attn_out stored in memory space 4 (prefill scratch)
    // KV matrices will be migrated to KV cache bank bundles after prefill

// === Logic-PIM: Decoding attention (parallel with xPU prefill) ===
// Decoding: 64 requests, each with unique KV cache
// Request and head parallelism: all independent

for each Logic-PIM stack (5 stacks per device):
    // Stack processes subset of (req, head) pairs
    for (req, h) in assigned_pairs:
        Q_vec = Q[req, h]                    // [1, 128]
        K_mat = K_cache[req, h]              // [seq_len_req, 128]
        V_mat = V_cache[req, h]              // [seq_len_req, 128]

        // GEMV: Q_vec × K_mat^T  [1, 128] × [128, seq_len] = [1, seq_len]
        // Low Op/B: single Q vector, KV unique per request
        // Logic-PIM GEMM module: read Q from buffer, K from bank bundle
        // 4x HBM bandwidth accelerates memory-bound GEMV

        scores = QK_vec  // [1, seq_len]
        // Softmax on Logic-PIM softmax module
        softmax_out = softmax_module(scores / sqrt(128))
        // × V_mat: [1, seq_len] × [seq_len, 128] = [1, 128]
        attn_vec = softmax_out × V_mat

    // Results gathered to output buffer

// === Synchronization ===
// xPU and Logic-PIM operate in parallel on different bank bundles
// Bank bundle assignment:
//   - Prefill Q/K/V: memory space 4 (bank bundle 4)
//   - Decoding KV cache: memory spaces 1-3 (bank bundles 1-3)
//   → No bank bundle conflict between xPU prefill and Logic-PIM decoding

// After both complete:
// xPU migrates prefill K/V from space 4 to KV cache spaces (done once)
// Projection layer: xPU concatenates all heads and executes FC
```

关键insight：prefill attention是高Op/B操作（Q rows数=Lin=2048，共享K/V→GEMM-like），适合xPU的高计算能力。decoding attention是低Op/B操作（每request仅1个token→GEMV-like，per-request unique KV→大量DRAM read），适合Logic-PIM的高带宽。两者在mixed stage共存→attention co-processing利用这一特性parallelize。

术语一般如何实现？如何使用？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
- **Bank bundle allocation关键**：attention co-processing依赖bank bundle-aware memory allocation。KV cache分配在bank bundles 1-3上（由Logic-PIM读取），prefill Q/K/V分配在bank bundle 4上（由xPU读写）。prefill完成后xPU将生成的K/V矩阵从bundle 4迁移到bundles 1-3（one-time migration per prefill, overhead negligible）。
- **request parallelism**：不同request的attention无data dependency→可fully parallelize across Logic-PIM stacks。Head parallelism：不同head的(Q, K, V) slices独立→也可fully parallelize。
- **GQA的影响**：GQA (deggrp=4-8)使attention的Op/B从MHA的~1-2升至4-8→Logic-PIM的compute-to-bandwidth ratio=8恰好匹配此范围。MHA (deggrp=1)下attention Op/B极低→Bank-PIM可能更优（如Duplex在OPT with MHA上的结果显示Bank-PIM优于Logic-PIM）。
- **与expert co-processing的协同**：两co-processing技术交替应用于不同layer——attention co-processing处理attention layers（mixed stage），expert co-processing处理MoE layers（所有stages），共同提升overall throughput。
- **GPU-only对比**：GPU-only必须sequential执行prefill和decoding attention（或在不同SMs上分时执行但受限于shared HBM bandwidth）。Logic-PIM的独立bank bundle path避免了bandwidth contention。

